-computing-the-emergence-of-a-collective-artificial-intelligence-at-the-edge-of-the-internet","totalDownloads":306,"totalCrossrefCites":2,"signatures":"Laisa Costa de Biase, Geovane Fedrecheski, Pablo Calcina-Ccori, Roseli Lopes and Marcelo Zuffo","reviewType":"peer-reviewed","isPublished":true,"isOnlineFirst":false,"isDeactivated":0,"status":"active","authors":[{"id":"516256","title":"Assistant Prof.","name":"Laisa","middleName":"","surname":"Costa de Biase","fullName":"Laisa Costa de Biase","slug":"laisa-costa-de-biase"},{"id":"520860","title":"Prof.","name":"Marcelo","middleName":"","surname":"Zuffo","fullName":"Marcelo Zuffo","slug":"marcelo-zuffo"},{"id":"520861","title":"Dr.","name":"Pablo","middleName":"","surname":"Calcina-Ccori","fullName":"Pablo Calcina-Ccori","slug":"pablo-calcina-ccori"},{"id":"520862","title":"Associate Prof.","name":"Roseli","middleName":"","surname":"Lopes","fullName":"Roseli Lopes","slug":"roseli-lopes"},{"id":"520871","title":"Dr.","name":"Geovane","middleName":"","surname":"Fedrecheski","fullName":"Geovane Fedrecheski","slug":"geovane-fedrecheski"}]},{"id":"86394","type":"chapter","title":"Optimal Unmanned Aerial Vehicle Control and Designs for Load Balancing in Intelligent Wireless Communication Systems","slug":"optimal-unmanned-aerial-vehicle-control-and-designs-for-load-balancing-in-intelligent-wireless-commu","totalDownloads":959,"totalCrossrefCites":0,"signatures":"Abhishek Mondal, Deepak Mishra, Ganesh Prasad and Ashraf Hossain","reviewType":"peer-reviewed","isPublished":true,"isOnlineFirst":false,"isDeactivated":0,"status":"active","authors":[{"id":"510101","title":"Dr.","name":"Abhishek","middleName":"","surname":"Mondal","fullName":"Abhishek Mondal","slug":"abhishek-mondal"},{"id":"516816","title":"Dr.","name":"Deepak","middleName":"","surname":"Mishra","fullName":"Deepak Mishra","slug":"deepak-mishra"},{"id":"516817","title":"Dr.","name":"Ganesh","middleName":"","surname":"Prasad","fullName":"Ganesh Prasad","slug":"ganesh-prasad"},{"id":"516818","title":"Dr.","name":"Ashraf","middleName":"","surname":"Hossain","fullName":"Ashraf Hossain","slug":"ashraf-hossain"}]},{"id":"86671","type":"chapter","title":"IoT on an ESP32: Optimization Methods Regarding Battery Life and Write Speed to an SD-Card","slug":"iot-on-an-esp32-optimization-methods-regarding-battery-life-and-write-speed-to-an-sd-card","totalDownloads":794,"totalCrossrefCites":4,"signatures":"Lukas M. Broell, Christian Hanshans and Dominik Kimmerle","reviewType":"peer-reviewed","isPublished":true,"isOnlineFirst":false,"isDeactivated":0,"status":"active","authors":[{"id":"510631","title":"B.Sc.","name":"Lukas","middleName":null,"surname":"M. Broell","fullName":"Lukas M. Broell","slug":"lukas-m.-broell"},{"id":"517249","title":"Prof.","name":"Christian","middleName":"","surname":"Hanshans","fullName":"Christian Hanshans","slug":"christian-hanshans"},{"id":"517250","title":"Mr.","name":"Dominik","middleName":"","surname":"Kimmerle","fullName":"Dominik Kimmerle","slug":"dominik-kimmerle"}]},{"id":"87181","type":"chapter","title":"Perspective Chapter: 5G Enabling Technologies – Revolutionizing Transport, Environment, and Health","slug":"perspective-chapter-5g-enabling-technologies-revolutionizing-transport-environment-and-health","totalDownloads":503,"totalCrossrefCites":2,"signatures":"Kofi Sarpong Adu-Manu, Gabriel Amponsa Koranteng and Samuel Nii Adotei Brown","reviewType":"peer-reviewed","isPublished":true,"isOnlineFirst":false,"isDeactivated":0,"status":"active","authors":[{"id":"516422","title":"Mr.","name":"Gabriel Amponsa ","middleName":"","surname":"Koranteng ","fullName":"Gabriel Amponsa  Koranteng ","slug":"gabriel-amponsa-koranteng"},{"id":"516423","title":"Mr.","name":"Samuel Nii Adotei ","middleName":"","surname":"Brown","fullName":"Samuel Nii Adotei  Brown","slug":"samuel-nii-adotei-brown"},{"id":"649372","title":"Associate Prof.","name":"Kofi Sarpong","middleName":null,"surname":"Adu-Manu","fullName":"Kofi Sarpong Ad