ature":"Md. Salim Newaz Kazi","hash":"81bc639ba015fffc2535431cabefc20c","volumeInSeries":3,"fullTitle":"Nanocellulose - Sources, Preparations, and Applications","kuFlag":false,"editors":[{"id":"93483","title":"Prof.","name":"Md. Salim Newaz","middleName":null,"surname":"Kazi","slug":"md.-salim-newaz-kazi","fullName":"Md. Salim Newaz Kazi","cdnProfilePictureURL":"https:\u002F\u002Fcdnintech.com\u002Fmedia\u002Fauthor\u002F93483\u002F1763971428\u002Fprofile\u002Fimage1.jpg","orcid":"0000-0002-8267-1371","institutionString":"Universiti Malaya","institution":null}],"equalEditorOne":null,"equalEditorTwo":null,"equalEditorThree":null,"coeditorOne":null,"coeditorTwo":null,"coeditorThree":null,"coeditorFour":null,"coeditorFive":null,"productType":{"id":"1"}},{"type":"book","id":"1002015","title":"Advances in Nanosheets","subtitle":"Preparation, Properties and Applications","coverURL":"https:\u002F\u002Fintech-files.s3.amazonaws.com\u002Fa043Y00000vBvmRQAS\u002F0013919_TrikoderCover%20%282023-11-02%2013%3A09%3A14%29.jpg","slug":null,"isPublished":true,"publishedDate":"November 15th 2023","editedByType":null,"bookSignature":"Karthikeyan Krishnamoorthy","hash":"3f9903bae020c4edfe3e9d681e934763","volumeInSeries":1,"fullTitle":"Advances in Nanosheets - Preparation, Properties and Applications","kuFlag":false,"editors":[{"id":"278690","title":"Dr.","name":"Karthikeyan","middleName":null,"surname":"Krishnamoorthy","slug":"karthikeyan-krishnamoorthy","fullName":"Karthikeyan Krishnamoorthy","cdnProfilePictureURL":"https:\u002F\u002Fcdnintech.com\u002Fmedia\u002Fauthor\u002F278690\u002F1745919953\u002Fprofile\u002Fimage1.jpg","orcid":"0000-0002-8519-3010","institutionString":null,"institution":{"name":"Advanced Materials and Processes Research Institute","institutionURL":null,"country":{"name":"India"}}}],"equalEditorOne":null,"equalEditorTwo":null,"equalEditorThree":null,"coeditorOne":null,"coeditorTwo":null,"coeditorThree":null,"coeditorFour":null,"coeditorFive":null,"productType":{"id":"1"}}]},"testimonialsList":[{"id":"8","text":"I work with IntechOpen for a number of reasons: their professionalism, their mission in support of Open Access publishing, and the quality of their peer-reviewed publications, but also because they believe in equality.","author":{"id":"202192","name":"Catrin","surname":"Sian Rutland","institutionString":null,"countryString":"United Kingdom","cdnProfilePictureURL":"https:\u002F\u002Fcdnintech.com\u002Fmedia\u002Fauthor\u002F202192\u002F1732711297\u002Fprofile\u002Fimage1.png","slug":"catrin-sian-rutland","institution":{"id":"134","name":"University of Nottingham","country":{"id":191,"name":"United Kingdom"}}}},{"id":"30","text":"My collaboration has been an exceptional experience. The editorial team offers a perfect mix of high professionalism and deep respect for scientific autonomy. The result is an efficient process and a rigorous publication that ensures a truly significant global impact. Highly recommended!","author":{"id":"315030","name":"Sandro","surname":"Serpa","institutionString":null,"countryString":null,"cdnProfilePictureURL":"https:\u002F\u002Fcdnintech.com\u002Fmedia\u002Fauthor\u002F315030\u002F1778487756\u002Fprofile\u002Fimage1.jpg","slug":"sandro-serpa","institution":{"id":"451","name":"Universidade dos Açores","country":{"id":147,"name":"Portugal"}}}},{"id":"29","text":"My experience with IntechOpen as an Academic Editor has been truly rewarding. The collaboration has always been smooth, professional, and effective. Working with IntechOpen has also given me the opportunity to broaden my global scholarly network. I look forward to continuing this partnership and making further contributions.","author":{"id":"52613","name":"Sadia","surname":"Ameen","institutionString":null,"countryString":"Republic of Korea","cdnProfilePictureURL":"https:\u002F\u002Fcdnintech.com\u002Fmedia\u002Fauthor\u002F52613\u002F1779366101\u002Fprofile\u002Fimage1.png","slug":"sadia-ameen","institution":{"id":"5057","name":"Jeonbuk National University","country":{"id":97,"name":"Korea, South"}}}},{"id":"32","text":"My collaboration with IntechOpen has always been a very positive experience. Their professionalism, efficient editorial support, and commitment to open access make the publishing process smooth and transparent. The visibility and impact of the published works are remarkable, and I highly value the opportunity to contribute to such an innovative and inclusive platform.","author":{"id":"128342","name":"Vito","surname":"Bobek","institutionString":"University of Ljubljana, Faculty of Social Sciences, Slovenia","countryString":"Austria","cdnProfilePictureURL":"https:\u002F\u002Fcdnintech.com\u002Fmedia\u002Fauthor\u002F128342\u002F1779616590\u002Fprofile\u002Fimage1.jpg","slug":"vito-bobek","institution":null}},{"id":"28","text":"Many years of very good cooperation with many employees of the publishing house, an extremely high level of expertise and assistance in all work on many books, with very good and quick personal contact.","author":{"id":"50150","name":"Robert","surname":"Koprowski","institutionString":null,"countryString":null,"cdnProfilePictureURL":"https:\u002F\u002Fcdnintech.com\u002Fmedia\u002Fauthor\u002F50150\u002F1734011523\u002Fprofile\u002Fimage1.jpg","slug":"robert-koprowski","institution":{"id":"875","name":"University of Silesia in Katowice","country":{"id":146,"name":"Poland"}}}},{"id":"31","text":"Collaborating in an editorial such as IntechOpen, which promotes Open Access, is valuable for scientific dissemination and the accessibility of global research.","author":{"id":"126286","name":"Luis","surname":"Jesús Villarreal-Gómez","institutionString":null,"countryString":"Mexico","cdnProfilePictureURL":"https:\u002F\u002Fcdnintech.com\u002Fmedia\u002Fauthor\u002F126286\u002F1734438892\u002Fprofile\u002Fimage1.png","slug":"luis-jesus-villarreal-gomez","institution":{"id":"6202","name":"Universidad Autónoma de Baja California","country":{"id":119,"name":"Mexico"}}}},{"id":"33","text":"In my experience, providing open access research and theory insights is essential to engage with practitioners and the general public. Publishing paywalls are discouraging for the individual trying to learn and improve their practice or make decisions about interventions for themselves or their loved ones. Consider publishing open access and sharing your exciting and inspirational work with a bigger international audience.","author":{"id":"348225","name":"Ann","surname":"Hemingway","institutionString":null,"countryString":null,"cdnProfilePictureURL":"https:\u002F\u002Fcdnintech.com\u002Fmedia\u002Fauthor\u002F348225\u002F1765532307\u002Fprofile\u002Fimage1.jpg","slug":"ann-hemingway","institution":{"id":"1129","name":"Bournemouth University","country":{"id":191,"name":"United Kingdom"}}}},{"id":"18","text":"It was great publishing with IntechOpen, the process was straightforward and I had support all along.","author":{"id":"71579","name":"Berend","surname":"Olivier","institutionString":null,"countryString":"Netherlands","cdnProfilePictureURL":"https:\u002F\u002Fcdnintech.com\u002Fmedia\u002Fauthor\u002F71579\u002F1762940504\u002Fprofile\u002Fimage1.png","slug":"berend-olivier","institution":{"id":"253","name":"Utrecht University","country":{"id":129,"name":"Netherlands"}}}},{"id":"27","text":"The opportunity to work with a prestigious publisher allows for the possibility to collaborate with more research groups interested in animal nutrition, leading to the development of new feeding strategies and food valuation while being more sustainable with the environment, allowing more readers to learn about the subject.","author":{"id":"175967","name":"Manuel","surname":"Gonzalez Ronquillo","institutionString":null,"countryString":null,"cdnProfilePictureURL":"https:\u002F\u002Fcdnintech.com\u002Fmedia\u002Fauthor\u002F175967\u002F1765096607\u002Fprofile\u002Fimage1.jpg","slug":"manuel-gonzalez-ronquillo","institution":{"id":"6221","name":"Universidad Autónoma del Estado de México","country":{"id":119,"name":"Mexico"}}}}]},"submityourwork":{"pteSeriesList":[],"lsSeriesList":[],"hsSeriesList":[],"sshSeriesList":[],"subseriesList":[],"annualVolumeBook":{},"thematicCollection":[],"selectedSeries":null,"selectedSubseries":null},"seriesLanding":{"item":null,"publishedBooks":null,"onlineFirstChapters":null,"ofChaptersTotal":null,"ofChaptersOffset":0,"ofChaptersLimit":2},"libraryRecommendation":{"success":null,"errors":{},"institutions":[],"countries":[]},"climateChangeHub":{"climateChangeHubBooks":[],"sustainableDevelopmentSeriesChapters":[],"sustainableDevelopmentSeriesChaptersTotal":null,"sustainableDevelopmentSeriesChaptersOffset":0,"sustainableDevelopmentSeriesChaptersLimit":6,"environmentalSciencesSeriesChapters":[],"environmentalSciencesSeriesChaptersOffset":0,"environmentalSciencesSeriesChaptersLimit":6,"environmentalSciencesSeriesChaptersTotal":null,"sustainableDevelopmentSeries":{},"environmentalSciencesSeries":{},"climateNews":{},"articlesAndIssues":[]},"sdgHub":{"sustainableDevelopmentSeries":{},"environmentalSciencesSeries":{},"kuSelectBooks":[],"sdgOpenAccessBooks":[],"sdgArticles":[],"sdgNews":[],"sdgStats":{},"kuStats":{}},"womenInScience":{"womenInScienceBooks":[],"womenInScienceSeries":[],"openAccessBooks":[],"openAccessChapters":[],"editorialBoardMembers":[],"firstSixEditors":[],"otherSixEditors":[],"womenInScienceSpecialIssue":{},"acrtArticles":[],"geetArticles":[]},"userSession":{"userSessionRefresh":0,"isFetchingSession":false,"userSession":{"email":null,"uid":null}},"test":{"test1":{}},"countriesIndexPage":{"countries":[],"filterParams":{"page":1,"searchTerm":"","sort":""},"total":null,"globalStats":{},"intechStatistics":{}},"country":{"country":{"id":185,"name":"Turkey","totalAuthorsEditors":2810,"totalInstitutions":210},"institutions":[{"id":"5187","name":"Giresun University","statistics":{"numberOfAuthors":11}},{"id":"5173","name":"Sivas Cumhuriyet Üniversitesi","statistics":{"numberOfAuthors":11